              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano Ehuti ömoona wa Anati aruurë ho, Samugari naimukiri iribhaga reee. We naitërë Abhabhirisiti amagana asansabha (600) ni isiare ya kuriisiria iching'ombe. Nawe guiki naabhohooyi Abhaisiraeri.",
